{
  "id": "E160",
  "title": "Repairing Your Bicycle",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-10-15",
  "synopsis": "It’s cheap to repair your bike in China.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/549/9cb6b79a78d608e4bd19a6353a271aca90ba3a92.mp3?1507447369",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "修自行车 \n\n李力：师傅，我要修车。\n师傅：你的车哪儿出问题了？\n李力：前轮车胎好像坏了，您看看能不能修?\n师傅：我看看……内胎上有个小洞，很容易补。\n李力：多少钱？\n师傅：这个便宜，五块钱。\n李力：什么时候能修好？\n师傅：你明天早上来取吧。\n李力：好的，谢谢你。\n师傅：不客气。",
    "traditional": "修自行車 \n\n李力：師傅，我要修車。\n師傅：你的車哪兒出問題了？\n李力：前輪車胎好像壞了，您看看能不能修?\n師傅：我看看……內胎上有個小洞，很容易補。\n李力：多少錢？\n師傅：這個便宜，五塊錢。\n李力：什麼時候能修好？\n師傅：你明天早上來取吧。\n李力：好的，謝謝你。\n師傅：不客氣。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Repairing the bicycle"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "李力：师傅，我要修车。",
      "traditional": "李力：師傅，我要修車。",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì shī fu wǒ yào xiū chē",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Li: Excuse me, I need to repair my bicycle."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "师傅：你的车哪儿出问题了？",
      "traditional": "師傅：你的車哪兒出問題了？",
      "pinyin": "shī fu nǐ de chē nǎ'r chū wèn tí le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Master: What’s the problem with your bicycle?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "李力：前轮车胎好像坏了，您看看能不能修?",
      "traditional": "李力：前輪車胎好像壞了，您看看能不能修?",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì qián lún chē tāi hǎo xiàng huài le nín kàn kan néng bù néng xiū",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Li: It seems like the tire on the front wheel is broken. Can you repair it?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "师傅：我看看……内胎上有个小洞，很容易补。",
      "traditional": "師傅：我看看……內胎上有個小洞，很容易補。",
      "pinyin": "shī fu wǒ kàn kan nèi tāi shang yǒu ge xiǎo dòng hěn róng yì bǔ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Master: Let me take a look… There is a small hole on the inner tube. It’s easy to repair."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "李力：多少钱？",
      "traditional": "李力：多少錢？",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì duō shao qián",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Li: How much does it cost?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "师傅：这个便宜，五块钱。",
      "traditional": "師傅：這個便宜，五塊錢。",
      "pinyin": "shī fu zhè ge pián yi wǔ kuài qián",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Master: It’s cheap, 5 yuan."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "李力：什么时候能修好？",
      "traditional": "李力：什麼時候能修好？",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì shén me shí hou néng xiū hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Li: When will it be done?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "师傅：你明天早上来取吧。",
      "traditional": "師傅：你明天早上來取吧。",
      "pinyin": "shī fu nǐ míng tiān zǎo shang lái qǔ ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Master: You can come and pick it up tomorrow morning."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "李力：好的，谢谢你。",
      "traditional": "李力：好的，謝謝你。",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì hǎo de xiè xie nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Li: Ok, thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "师傅：不客气。",
      "traditional": "師傅：不客氣。",
      "pinyin": "shī fu bú kè qi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Master: You’re welcome."
    }
  ],
